## Lore and history

Explore [Atomer's setting and institutions](world/WORLD.md), [characters](world/CHARACTERS.md), [places](world/PLACES.md) and [creatures](world/CREATURES_AND_MONSTERS.md). The [chronology](world/CHRONOLOGY.md) follows the story's discoveries and turning points. The third arc closes the played campaign, including its one-year epilogue; the final invitation and unopened letter leave their own questions.

## Sources and project notes

All three arcs and the played campaign conclude at **S3E12 — KOA is not A-OK**. The three primary narratives and world-reference rollout have received preserved editorial passes, followed by a [bounded campaign integration check](../reports/DELVERS_CAMPAIGN_INTEGRATION_2026-10-27.md). Source and listening questions remain open in the review queue; editorial cleanup does not certify every underlying claim.

