The 37 main-campaign dossiers are present with ASR-provisional text research. Source availability, complete input comparison, independent narrative reading and actual audio listening remain separate evidence states. No main-campaign episode follows S3E12. Separately catalogued bonuses remain commentary and do not extend the played campaign by default.

### Evidence boundary

The [guild-guide provenance register](../reports/DISCORD_SPELLING_2026-10-21.md) supplies setting-handout evidence, distinct from played events. Character testimony, visions, hallucinations, retrospective commentary and unchosen plans retain their own attribution. Later revelations do not overwrite what characters knew at an earlier point.

The final invitation is shown without a performed wedding; the red royal letter remains unopened. Use the finale dossier for the detailed limits rather than completing these hooks editorially. Pre-cleanup navigation and research milestones remain in the [dated archive](../research/legacy/2026-10-26/delvers-campaign-cleanup/README.md).

